WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.910
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:07.940
SPEAKER: Hello.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.790
Today we'll be talking about how
to make your data in a bucket

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.460
public to everyone
on the internet.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.430
This means that your data
will be readable to everyone

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:17.690
on the internet.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:21.350
I've created a bucket
called tiny_homes.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.800
In this bucket, I'll be
storing photos of tiny homes.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.520
As you can see, right now,
all the images are private,

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.440
but I want to make
these images public

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.180
so people can access them.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.890
So the first step is to open
the Cloud Storage Browser

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.510
in Google Cloud Console.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.330
When we are in the bucket,
we can see all the files

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.960
that live in the bucket.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.380
So to make a single file
public, what we want to do

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.990
is we want to click
the Actions menu, which

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:56.610
is the three little bars
to the side of the file.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.530
We want to select
Edit Permissions

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.980
from the drop-down menu.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:04.739
Then we want to
add a new entity.

00:01:04.739 --> 00:01:08.010
The entity name should
be Public, then allUsers,

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.040
and then Reader, and
then just click Save.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.775
And as you can
see, we have a link

00:01:13.775 --> 00:01:15.150
that we can share
with anyone who

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.970
wants to view this specific
file in the bucket.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.660
But let's say we want to make
all the images in this folder

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.428
public.

00:01:22.428 --> 00:01:24.720
It would be tedious to do
the actions that we performed

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:28.140
earlier to every item in the
bucket, so what we can do

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:32.140
is we can click the
Edit Permissions button,

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:39.130
add a new member
called all_users,

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:42.760
set their role as Storage Object
Viewer in the Cloud Storage

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:45.440
section, and that's it.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:48.880
You've made every image
in our bucket public.

